WEBVTT

00:02:59.200 --> 00:03:01.654
The first thing I want to do
is start with a graph.

00:03:01.678 --> 00:03:02.976
This graph looks boring,

00:03:03.000 --> 00:03:05.951
but it is the reason I get excited
and wake up every morning.

00:03:05.975 --> 00:03:08.740
And this graph doesn't even mean
anything; it's fake data.

00:03:08.764 --> 00:03:10.035
What we found is --

00:03:10.059 --> 00:03:12.976
(Laughter)

00:03:13.000 --> 00:03:15.976
If I got this data studying you,
I would be thrilled,

00:03:16.000 --> 00:03:17.976
because there's a trend there,

00:03:18.000 --> 00:03:19.976
and that means that I can get published,

00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:21.976
which is all that really matters.

00:03:22.000 --> 00:03:24.076
There is one weird red dot
above the curve,

00:03:24.100 --> 00:03:26.601
there's one weirdo in the room --

00:03:26.625 --> 00:03:29.650
I know who you are, I saw you earlier --

00:03:29.674 --> 00:03:30.976
that's no problem.